"""Shared output contract for readable, retrievable event captions."""

CAPTION_STYLE_EN = '''A caption remains ONE string, but write it as chronological complete sentences separated by newline characters. Each nonempty line records one main visible observation together with only its necessary detail or uncertainty. One observation may use one line; do not target a fixed number of lines. Prefer an explicit subject when it is visually supported, so a line can be retrieved on its own; never guess an identity to make a subject explicit. Preserve observed repetitions, counts, readable text, changes, and uncertainty. State an absence only when it is directly supported by the shown observation and restrict it to that observation; never turn an unobserved detail into "did not happen." Do not force an order among simultaneous or static facts.
Do not use headings, list numbering, bullets, labels, dimensions, invented timestamp tags, markdown, or separate records. Do not make one line into one event. Do not infer intent, causal explanations, unobserved actions, or persistence through an unseen gap. In JSON, encode each newline inside the caption string as the legal escape \\n, not as a literal line break inside the JSON string.'''

CAPTION_STYLE_ZH = '''caption 仍是一个字符串，但要按可证观察顺序写成多行完整句：每个非空行只记录一个主要可见观察及其必要细节或不确定性。一个观察可以只写一行，不规定行数。画面支持时尽量写清主语，使单行可独立检索；画面无法确认身份时不得为了主语而猜测。保留重复实例、次数、可读文字、变化和不确定性。只有画面直接支持且限定在当前观察范围内时才写“未出现”，不得把没看到的细节写成“没有发生”。静态或同时可见的事实不要强行写成先后顺序。
不要写标题、列表编号、项目符号、字段标签、维度、凭空添加的时间标签、Markdown 或多个记录。每一行不是一个事件。不要推测动机、因果、未见动作或不可见间隔中的持续状态。JSON 中 caption 字符串的换行必须写成合法转义 \\n，不能在字符串内直接换行。'''
